# App code conventions

- Path alias `@/` as already configured; match existing file layout under `src/`.
- Expo Router file-based routes under `src/app/`.
- Prefer existing stacks: NativeWind, Zustand, Zod, RHF.
- Server/async data: TanStack Query once Supabase is wired; avoid ad-hoc fetch soup.
- Do not add OCR/AI SDKs or insurer SDKs before the roadmap says so.
- Keep components focused; no drive-by refactors outside the task.
- Verify APIs against Expo SDK 57 docs before using new modules.
